\title{icesAdviceSheet: Draft ICES Advice Sheets from SID, SAG and ASD}
\description{
Generates draft ICES advice sheets as Word documents for a given stock and assessment year. Stock information comes from the ICES Stock Information Database (SID), assessment results, confidence bounds and reference points from Stock Assessment Graphs (SAG), and the advice, catch scenarios and advice history from the Advice and Scenarios Database (ASD). The draft uses the ICES advice template, draws the ICES standard graphs, and marks missing or inconsistent data, and text still to be written by the expert group, for follow-up.
